WEBVTT

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:31.244
have such a visceral hatred, anger,

00:07:31.244 --> 00:07:32.912
at some of these banking CEOs

00:07:32.912 --> 00:07:35.740
with their disproportionate
salaries and bonus structures.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.710
It's not the numbers.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:40.548
It's that they have violated the
very definition of leadership.

00:07:40.548 --> 00:07:43.442
They have violated this deep-seated social contract.

00:07:43.442 --> 00:07:45.045
We know that they allowed their people

00:07:45.045 --> 00:07:47.560
to be sacrificed so they could
protect their own interests,

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:50.752
or worse, they sacrificed their people

00:07:50.752 --> 00:07:52.212
to protect their own interests.

00:07:52.212 --> 00:07:55.023
This is what so offends us, not the numbers.

00:07:55.023 --> 00:07:56.620
Would anybody be offended if we gave

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.193
a $150 million bonus to Gandhi?

00:07:59.193 --> 00:08:02.232
How about a $250 million bonus to Mother Teresa?